### Definition of Downcasting

**Downcasting** is the conversion of an object reference from a superclass type **downward** to a more specialized subclass type in the inheritance hierarchy.

Unlike upcasting, downcasting represents a **narrowing** conversion and **requires an explicit cast**:
```java
Vehicle v = new SportsCar();
SportsCar car = (SportsCar) v; // Explicit downcast
```

**The 3 Critical Rules of Downcasting:**
1. **Explicit Cast Required**: The compiler will not implicitly downcast; you must provide `(SubclassName) ref`.
2. **The Danger of ClassCastException**: If the actual object on the Heap is NOT an instance of the target subclass (e.g. `v` points to a `Truck` or plain `Vehicle`), the JVM throws a fatal **`ClassCastException`** at runtime.
3. **Always Check with instanceof**: To guarantee safety, always verify the runtime type with `instanceof` before executing a downcast.

---

### Safe Downcasting in Code

```java
class MediaFile {
    private final String title;
    public MediaFile(String title) { this.title = title; }
    public String getTitle() { return title; }
}

class VideoFile extends MediaFile {
    private final int resolution;

    public VideoFile(String title, int resolution) {
        super(title);
        this.resolution = resolution;
    }

    public void render4kStream() {
        System.out.println("Streaming '" + getTitle() + "' in " + resolution + "p Ultra HD");
    }
}

public class DowncastingDemo {
    public static void playMedia(MediaFile file) {
        System.out.println("Loading media: " + file.getTitle());

        // Safe Downcasting pattern
        if (file instanceof VideoFile) {
            VideoFile video = (VideoFile) file; // Safe downcast
            video.render4kStream();
        }
    }

    public static void main(String[] args) {
        MediaFile video = new VideoFile("Inception", 2160);
        MediaFile audio = new MediaFile("Podcast Episode 1");

        playMedia(video);
        playMedia(audio);
    }
}
```

**Console Output:**
```text
Loading media: Inception
Streaming 'Inception' in 2160p Ultra HD
Loading media: Podcast Episode 1
```

---

### Summary Checklist

Never cast without checking. Unconditional downcasting (`(ChildClass) parentRef`) without `instanceof` is an amateur anti-pattern that leads to production outages.

